  "description": "Arkansas National Guard Wildfire Response Update\r\nOperations are fully underway near Camden, Arkansas. As of 11:30 AM, the Arkansas National Guard's 77th Expeditionary Combat Aviation Brigade has dropped 16,800 gallons of water on the wildfire.\r\n\r\nFollowing an order from Governor Sarah Huckabee Sanders, two UH-60 Black Hawk helicopters equipped with Bambi buckets deployed from Camp Joseph T. Robinson and have been operating out of the Camden area since approximately 7:00 AM.",
